{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34182","headline":"杂讽九首 七 · 陆龟蒙","name":"杂讽九首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"左右佩劒者，彼此亦相笑。\n趋时与闭门，喧寂不同调。\n潜机取声利，自许臻乎妙。\n志士以神窥，惭然真可吊。\n天之发遐籁，大小随万窍。\n魁其罏冶姿，形质惟所召。\n鼗笙磬竽瑟，是必登清庙。\n伊圣不可欺，谁能守蓬藋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34182.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34182","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}